domain consistency and retry only when safe.')]} 
    return m.get(d,m['platform'])

def evidence(d): return E.get(d,E['platform'])[2]
def checklist(d):
    base=['Confirm the intended actor and environment.','Confirm the current authoritative state before changing anything.','Capture HTTP status, stable error code and request/correlation ID without secrets.','Validate the owning component health and required dependency/configuration.','After the action, reload the state from the backend and confirm the expected result.']
    if d=='devops': base+=['Confirm the deployed artifact/revision and readiness.','If rollback is used, verify the previous revision is healthy before closing the change.']
    if d in ('security','admin'): base+=['Confirm least privilege and audit evidence for the sensitive action.']
    return base

def cover(c,spec):
    rel,title,subtitle,kind,default=spec; hf(c,title,kind,1); bg,fg,sub=pal(kind); y=H-170; c.setFillColor(fg); c.setFont(BOLD,28)
    for ln in wrap(title,34): c.drawString(42,y,ln); y-=34
    c.setFillColor(sub); c.setFont(FONT,11.5)
    for ln in wrap(subtitle,70): c.drawString(42,y,ln); y-=17
    logo(c,W/2-50,y-115,100); y-=142
    y=sec(c,'Summary',y,kind); y=para(c,'This document explains the subject in straightforward professional English, then adds the engineering detail needed to build, operate, troubleshoot or review it. Claims are based on the repository evidence snapshot; missing source details are called out instead of guessed.',42,y,kind,n=88,size=8.5,lead=11)
    y-=7; y=sec(c,'Document details',y,kind); para(c,f'Edition 2.0 | Evidence date: {DATE} | Repository: {REPO} | Product evidence snapshot: main @ {SNAPSHOT}',42,y,kind,n=90,size=7.7,lead=10)

def summary_page(c,spec,p=2):
    rel,title,subtitle,kind,default=spec; hf(c,title,kind,p); y=heading(c,'Summary and how to use this document',H-98,kind)
    y=para(c,f'{subtitle} The purpose is to make the system understandable to a new team member while still giving engineers enough detail to trace ownership, data flow, deployment impact and failure handling.',42,y-5,kind,n=88,size=8.6,lead=11)
    box(c,'Current implementation','Direct code, README, migration, pipeline or commit evidence exists on the reviewed main snapshot.',42,y-18,245,70,kind,GREEN); box(c,'Foundation / partial','Useful groundwork exists, but the repository does not prove a complete production runtime for every part.',308,y-18,245,70,kind,AMBER)
    y-=105; box(c,'Legacy / reference','Older implementation is retained for history or compatibility and is not treated as the preferred runtime.',42,y,245,70,kind,MUTED); box(c,'Needs source confirmation','A referenced artifact or exact value could not be verified and is therefore not invented.',308,y,245,70,kind,AMBER)
    y-=105; y=sec(c,'Reading order',y,kind); bullets(c,['Start with the summary to understand the responsibility in normal language.','Use process diagrams to follow requests across client, APIM, services, data and providers.','Use the troubleshooting sections to diagnose by evidence rather than by retrying blindly.','Use deployment and validation sections before or after changing a component.','Use evidence status to separate proven behavior from gaps and future work.'],y,kind)

def heading(c,text,y,kind,size=18.5):
    _,fg,_=pal(kind); c.setFillColor(fg); c.setFont(BOLD,size)
    for ln in wrap(text,56): c.drawString(42,y,ln); y-=size+3
    return y

def arch_page(c,spec,p=3):
    rel,title,subtitle,kind,default=spec; hf(c,title,kind,p); y=heading(c,'How the request moves through Craves',H-98,kind); y=para(c,'The exact components depend on the feature, but the normal pattern is consistent. The user interface starts the request, the gateway and owning service enforce trust, the service writes authoritative state, and provider integrations remain behind controlled boundaries.',42,y-4,kind,n=88,size=8.5,lead=11); y-=14; y=draw_flow(c,['Customer / Chef / Admin','Web BFF or Mobile client','Azure API Management','Owning Spring Boot service','PostgreSQL / approved provider'],y,kind); y=sec(c,'Key rule',y,kind); para(c,'A screen can hide or show an action for usability, but that is not security. APIM and the owning backend still validate the caller, role, ownership and current business state. Likewise, provider success is not accepted as Craves state until the backend verifies and records the result.',42,y,kind,n=88,size=8.2,lead=10.7)

def topic_page(c,spec,p,topic,aspect):
    rel,title,subtitle,kind,default=spec; hf(c,title,kind,p); d=domain(topic+' '+aspect,default); st,col,note=status(topic,d); y=heading(c,f'{simple_name(topic)} - {aspect}',H-98,kind); c.setFillColor(col); c.roundRect(42,y-5,140,18,9,fill=1,stroke=0); c.setFillColor(WHITE); c.setFont(BOLD,7); c.drawCentredString(112,y+1,st); y-=28
    y=sec(c,'Summary',y,kind); y=para(c,explanation(topic,d),42,y,kind,n=88,size=8.15,lead=10.4,maxlines=9); y-=4
    y=sec(c,'Technical explanation',y,kind); y=para(c,technical(topic,d),42,y,kind,n=88,size=7.9,lead=10.1,maxlines=10); y-=4
    y=sec(c,'Process flow',y,kind); y=draw_flow(c,flow(topic,d),y,kind); y=sec(c,'Common issues and resolution',y,kind)
    rows=problems(d)[:2];
    for issue,cause,action in rows: y=para(c,f'{issue}: {cause}. Resolution: {action}',42,y,kind,n=88,size=7.6,lead=9.6,maxlines=4); y-=3
    y=sec(c,'Validation and evidence',y,kind); para(c,f'{note} Evidence: {evidence(d)}. Validate using authoritative state, health/readiness where relevant, and request/correlation evidence. Never paste credentials, OTPs, tokens or provider secrets into tickets or documentation.',42,y,kind,n=88,size=7.55,lead=9.5,maxlines=7)

def regular_topics(default):
    a=ANCHORS.get(default,ANCHORS['platform']); aspects=['Overview and responsibility','Functional behavior and data','Operations, errors and deployment']; out=[]
    for t in a:
        for asp in aspects: out.append((t,asp))
    i=0
    while len(out)<52: out.append((a[i%len(a)],'Security, evidence and change impact')); i+=1
    return out[:52]

def closing(c,spec,p):
    rel,title,subtitle,kind,default=spec; hf(c,title,kind,p); y=heading(c,'Operational checklist and documented gaps',H-98,kind); y=sec(c,'Before making a change',y,kind); y=bullets(c,checklist(default),y,kind,maxitems=7); y=sec(c,'Repository gaps that must stay visible',y,kind); y=bullets(c,GAPS,y,kind,n=82,maxitems=5); y=sec(c,'Definition of done',y,kind); para(c,'A change is complete only when the intended behavior works, authorization still fails closed, authoritative data is correct, health/readiness are good, monitoring or correlation evidence is available, the rollback path remains valid, and the documentation has been updated if the contract or operating procedure changed.',42,y,kind,n=88,size=8.1,lead=10.5)

def build_regular(spec):
    rel,title,subtitle,kind,default=spec; path=OUT/rel; path.parent.mkdir(parents=True,exist_ok=True); c=canvas.Canvas(str(path),pagesize=A4,pageCompression=1,title=title,author='Craves Documentation'); cover(c,spec); c.showPage(); summary_page(c,spec,2); c.showPage(); arch_page(c,spec,3); c.showPage(); p=4
    for t,a in regular_topics(default): topic_page(c,spec,p,t,a); c.showPage(); p+=1
    closing(c,spec,p); c.save()

